From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Add tests for g_type_ensure_initialized()

Add gobject/tests/ensure-initialized.c covering: explicit
initialization before any other type-system use, repeated idempotent
calls, concurrent calls from many threads, and plain GType/GObject
regression, and register it in the gobject test suite.

---
 gobject/tests/ensure-initialized.c | 143 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 gobject/tests/meson.build         |   1 +
 2 files changed, 144 insertions(+)
--- /dev/null	2026-07-20 07:48:39.439517500 +0800
+++ b/gobject/tests/ensure-initialized.c
@@ -0,0 +1,144 @@
+/* GObject - GLib Type, Object, Parameter and Signal Library
+ * Copyright (C) 2026 The GLib team
